OL,3,GNEWSAHow to reduce fire risks at home
OL,4,Athis Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs families across the West of England
OL,7,Fprepare for Christmas, they are being
OL,8,Foffered advice on reducing the risk of
OL,9,Ffire and staying safe.
OL,11,FThis time of year can often mean more
OL,12,Fcooking, electrical decorations,
OL,13,Fcandles and visitors in the home, all
OL,14,Fof which can increase fire hazards.
OL,16,FThe BBC has compiled a list of things
OL,17,Fyou can do to stay safe over the
OL,18,Ffestive season.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
